    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Potion, Legendary</em></p><p>When you drink this potion, you regain 8 Hit Points. At the start of each of your turns for the next 1 minute, you regain 8 Hit Points again if you have at least 1 Hit Point.</p><p>This thick green elixir is made from herbs. No trolls were harmed in the making of this elixir.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-JxkhjG2CAtYu4XVw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Une fois bue, la fiole vide reste dans l’inventaire pour garder l’activité <em>Regeneration</em> pendant la minute ; supprimez-la ensuite.</p></section>",
